%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um... I'm afraid I don't quite understand.\d%K%P
「那、那什么…您说的我有点儿没听懂」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\d...So that means you weren't aware of it either, eh?\d%K%P
「…也就是说，您还不知道吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA-Aware...? Surely this must be some sort of mistake.\d%K%P
「知、知道不知道的………不会吧？」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dThere's nothing to mistake about it. I hired a\ndetective.\d%K%P
「没错。\n这是侦探所调查出的结果」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA detective...? Why on earth would you do such a thing?\d%K%P
「侦探所…为什么要那么做…？」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dI was ready to spend the rest of my life with this woman.\nSo naturally, I'd want to make sure I knew everything\nabout her before we got married.\d%K%P
「那可是或许会成为自己老婆的女人啊。\n认真调查是必须的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut you're the one who proposed to her in the first\nplace...\d%K%P
「但是…你这么随便地…」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dI confronted her about it, and she acknowledged it on the\nspot. That was a shock. I thought she'd at least try to\nfeign ignorance.\d%K%P
「我向她本人确认，她干脆地承认了。\n我还以为她会佯装不知呢，但也真是意外啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dI almost got myself into one hell of a mess. I still\ncan't believe that woman's infertile, yeesh.\d%K%P
「险些上当了啊。\n…不孕症，嘿嘿，真是够了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...!\d%K%P
「啊…！」%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dNow, I wouldn't let it get to my head that she was\npreviously married, or older than me. ...I'm not that much\nof a close-minded man.\d%K%P
「虽然有过婚史，虽然比我的年纪大，\n但这些对我来说都没问题。\n…我的心胸可没那么狭隘」%K%P
I suddenly started to feel as if my vision was failing me.%K%P
我的视野，顿时染上了一抹白雾。%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dBut someone unable to bear children is out of the\nquestion. My parents would never accept something like\nthat.\d%K%P
「但是，不能生育是个致命的问题。\n这样的婚姻，我的父母是不会认可的」%K%P
I could hear what he was saying to me, but the meaning\nbehind his words seemed to go in one ear and out the\nother.%K%P
眼前之人说出的话，\n是通过怎样氤氲的空气传入我的耳中，\n这一点我已没有余力去探寻了。%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dI'm the second son in my family, so it's not like I have\nto inherit the whole household or anything. In exchange,\nthough, I have a duty to establish my own line as a real\nman.\d%K%P
「我是家里的次男。虽然不继承家业，\n但与此相应的，作为一家之主，\n我必须撑起这个家庭」%K%P
His words continued going through my head. And yet, I had\nneither comprehension of, nor empathy for, any of them.%K%P
我不能明白，我也不能接受。\n但是那些话，根本不听使唤地钻入我的大脑，让我挥之不去。%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dBut if she can't even have kids... Well, having to spend\nyour entire life alone with her, even your twilight years,\nis absolutely out of the question for me.\d%K%P
「但是，生育不了子女什么的…\n夫妇二人上了年纪，也不能长久地在一起吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe... can't have children?\d%K%P
「不能…生育」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d\dI thought I'd give birth to a child, raise them... and\nthat this would turn you into the loving father I\nwanted.\d\d%K%P
『组建家庭一起生活，生孩子，养大…\n那样的话，理也会像一般人那样喜欢小孩子，\n成为我所期望的孩子他爸』%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dStill, I realize there's been an increase in families\nthat focus on their jobs to the extent they don't even\nhave time for sex or having children.\d%K%P
「我也知道，最近因为夫妻双方都是职工，所以没有多少性生活，\n没有生育子女的家庭在增加」%K%P
Asami said she'd show me what it was like...%K%P
麻实她说过要向我呈现的…%K%P
...to have a normal home to call your own. To love your\nchildren. She wanted to teach me all about the true bliss\nof living for one's family.%K%P
呈现构筑家庭，爱着自己的孩子，为了家庭而工作的幸福…%K%P
About a future filled only with happiness.%K%P
呈现被那样的开心快乐所包裹的未来…%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dBut personally, I believe that to be wrong. At least,\nthat is my opinion as an educator.\d%K%P
「但是，我想还是有些弄错了。\n至少作为一个教育者来说」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWrong...?\d%K%P
「弄错了…？」%K%P
Did he mean, what Asami was trying to do? The future she'd\nenvisioned for us?%K%P
是麻实期望的幸福吗？\n是对我倾诉的、那未来的梦？%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dEducation doesn't only happen at school. What you learn\nat home is just as important. I mean, how can you guide\nthe children of others if you don't even know what it\nmeans to love your own?\d%K%P
「教育不仅仅是学校的事。家庭也非常重要。\n因为，连自己孩子都爱不了的人，\n又怎么能教导别人的子女呢？」%K%P
No, that wasn't it... This idiot in front of me wasn't\njust denying something which was already set in stone.%K%P
这不对…\n眼前的『这家伙』所否定的，\n才不是那种对麻实来说近乎绝望与奢望的现实。%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dAnd so, as an educator, I want to establish a loving\nhousehold. I want to be a parent who knows how to love\ntheir children.\d%K%P
「所以，我既然是一位教育者，也想成立一个温馨有爱的家庭。\n想和妻子一起，为自己的子女，奉献严父慈母的爱」%K%P
He was denying Asami herself. Someone who had been forced\nto live with this exact problem. Labeling her very\nexistence as \dwrong\d.%K%P
只是，直面那个残酷现实的，一个人的麻实，\n被以“弄错了”的说辞，否定了…\n一个人，只有她一个人…%K%P
And in looking for a scapegoat where there was none to be\nfound, he was ignoring the difference in meaning between\nbeing \dunable\d to and \dnot wanting\d to.%K%P
『不能生育』与『不想生育』，不知何时偷换了概念，\n不存在的罪魁，在脑海里诞生了…%K%P
%LCTeacher
%LC男老师
\dLesson learned, I guess. I was more naive than I\nthought.\d%K%P
「真是的，这次真是涨了经验。\n我还很年轻呢，这次我算是知道了」%K%P
Asami's dreams being shattered into pieces... And the\nfoolish thing she'd done in response to that...%K%P
麻实的梦，消散无迹…\n以及为此所做的种种无法理解的愚蠢行为…%K%P
He was trying to deny it. All of it.%K%P
一切一切，一切一切，一切一切…都被否定了。%K%P
